THEHIGHWRLD DASHBOARD - DESKTOP APP TERMS OF SERVICE\par
\par
Last updated: 22 November 2026\par
\par
1. ACCEPTANCE\par
By installing or using this application you agree to these terms. If you do not\par
agree, cancel the installation now.\par
\par
2. WHAT THIS APP IS\par
TheHighWRLD Dashboard is an unofficial, fan-made desktop application that opens\par
the public website at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehighwrlddashboard.pages.dev"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul thehighwrlddashboard.pages.dev\ul0\cf0}}} in its own window. It is\par
not affiliated with or endorsed by Juice WRLD, his estate, or any record label.\par
All music, artwork, names and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\par
\par
3. PERMITTED USE\par
Personal, non-commercial use only. Do not use this app or its community\par
features to harass, spam, impersonate anyone, scrape the service, or disrupt\par
the site or other members. The site rules shown in the app still apply.\par
\par
4. YOUR ACCOUNT AND DATA\par
Sign-in, playlists, favourites, messages, and profile settings are stored by\par
the service on its servers. The desktop app keeps a small local session so you\par
stay signed in between launches. You are responsible for your account and for\par
the content you post through the app.\par
\par
5. DISCORD RICH PRESENCE (OPTIONAL)\par
When you turn on Discord Rich Presence in Player Settings, the app shares the\par
track title, artist, and cover currently playing with the Discord desktop\par
client so friends can see your listening activity. Nothing is sent while the\par
toggle is off. Discord is a third-party service with its own terms.\par
\par
6. DOWNLOADS AND UPDATES\par
Installers are published on the project's public GitHub releases page. The\par
download page lists SHA256 checksums - verify your download before running it.\par
Updates are installed by downloading the new installer from that same page.\par
\par
7. NO WARRANTY\par
This app is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The maintainers\par
are not liable for any loss, damage, or data loss arising from its use.\par
\par
8. CHANGES\par
These terms may change. Continued use of the app after a change means you\par
accept the updated terms.\par
\par
9. CONTACT\par
Feedback and bug reports can be sent from inside the app: use the Suggestions\par
page to submit a report or idea, or use the Report action on a message or post\par
that breaks the site rules. GitHub Issues are not enabled for this project.\par
\par
By selecting "I accept the agreement" you confirm that you have read and agree\par
to these Terms of Service.\par
